        {
            "name": "KiWay Extract Pins",
            "description": "Advanced pin, interface, test-point, and TM/TC documentation generator for KiCad.",
            "description_full": "KiWay Extract Pins is a comprehensive documentation and analysis plugin for KiCAD.\n\n**Features:**\n- Extract component pin data to CSV, Markdown, HTML, or JSON\n- Build a networkx connectivity graph from pcbnew board data and optional KiCad XML netlists\n- Trace through passive parts and custom NetTie_Path pass-throughs\n- Resolve test points back to source IC pins and functions\n- Parse board-sequence labels such as DEMO_CTRL_DEMO_SENSOR_SIGNAL_SPI1_CLK_1_TD for TM/TC tables\n- Group differential pairs, buses, connectors, peripherals, and logical interfaces\n- Create native KiCad PCB groups for logical interfaces\n- Generate ICD/TM-TC Markdown, HTML, and CSV deliverables\n- CLI support for automation and scripting\n\nOptional Python packages for full dashboard capability: networkx, matplotlib, and markdown.\n\nTargets KiCAD 9 and later.",
            "identifier": "kiway.extract.pins",
            "type": "plugin",
            "author": {
                "name": "Wayri (Yawar)",
                "contact": {
                    "github": "https://github.com/wayri"
                }
            },
            "license": "GPL-3.0",
